Source: hyperv
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: hyperv-for-linux maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/olljanat-ai/hyperv-for-linux

Package: hyperv
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Recommends: linux-image-hyperv
Description: Microsoft Hypervisor for Linux (repackaged from Azure Linux non-oss)
 Ships the Microsoft Hypervisor loader, supporting payload, and firmware
 blobs, repackaged from packages.microsoft.com/azurelinux/3.0/prod/non-oss/.
 The postinst installs hvloader.efi onto the ESP and registers a
 systemd-boot entry that chainloads it.
